paperweight-skel (0.2.54-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * paperweight-theme: flock-based concurrency guard — only one theme switch
    runs at a time; rapid subsequent calls write a pending file and exit
    immediately (last-write-wins), preventing CPU thrashing on eMMC hardware.
  * paperweight-theme: per-phase millisecond benchmarks logged for sway reload,
    waybar restart, and swaync reload.
  * paperweight-theme: log rotation at 1000 lines (keeps last 800) to bound
    disk use on eMMC without an external logrotate dependency.
  * paperweight-theme: total elapsed time now reported in milliseconds.

